_:ne13c8b1c609d4fcfbf510ed85df402fdb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#description> "\r\n        property onFields specifies the fields in LogicalView that are involved by the structural annotation. The semantics of this involvement depends on the specific annotation.\r\n        " .
