_:n1b0a2a677c2749eaa9e7aa1292ae387eb1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        At least one rml:predicate or rml:predicateMap must be provided.\n        " .
_:nf971d602ca26417dbffe9ea5d8aa36a8b3 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#Alt> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLLogicalViewShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\n    A logical view (rml:LogicalView) is a type of abstract logical source that is derived from another abstract logical source by defining fields with data from said abstract logical source.\n    " .
_:n21ad341ad83e43e3b47c9d14fe5bf0c2b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
