_:n65852d54fe0841c5902c96267f13c1b8b1 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/mode> .
_:nf106a32cee6e4b8091a0d24c209afc75b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLJoinShape> .
_:n59f49f0be26f435080d9abf083ce0a3fb13 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/StructuralAnnotationShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n    Structural annotations provide a mechanism to express relationships between logical views, as well as additional information about fields.\r\n    " .
_:n8b314841b8f1402c8179c0abd21b17b0b35 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
