_:n8b314841b8f1402c8179c0abd21b17b0b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> <http://w3id.org/rml/logicalSource> .
_:n8b314841b8f1402c8179c0abd21b17b0b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#minCount> "1"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#integer> .
_:n1411e73ead8e410390ba935a1aae3885b2 <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#label> "rml:root" .
_:n2e72720998a04bf7a3869c476879b7d1b5 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#nodeKind> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#Literal> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/StructuralAnnotationShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\r\n    Node must have a valid rml:StructuralAnnotationShape description.\r\n    All structural annotations of a logical view lv MUST have an on fields property (rml:onFields), linking the structural annotation to a list of field names occurring in lv.\r\n    rml:StructuralAnnotationShape requires:\r\n    - exactly one rml:onFields property.\r\n    " .
_:n8b314841b8f1402c8179c0abd21b17b0b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> _:n8b314841b8f1402c8179c0abd21b17b0b8 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/LeafExpressionFieldShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n    A leaf expression field is an expression field without nested fields.\r\n    " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLIterableShape> <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#comment> "\r\n    An abstract construct to describe data access and iteration for a data source.\r\n    " .
_:nb95e36dfe2d14214b2b7a390db06555ab6 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#path> _:nb95e36dfe2d14214b2b7a390db06555ab7 .
_:n21ad341ad83e43e3b47c9d14fe5bf0c2b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:serialization must be an IRI from the W3C formats namespace,\n        and may be provided at most once.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLPredicateObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:n1b0a2a677c2749eaa9e7aa1292ae387eb5 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLRefObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#NodeShape> .
_:nb31bc0e4a2414395ab00c127f735f089b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#in> _:nb31bc0e4a2414395ab00c127f735f089b3 .
_:n8b314841b8f1402c8179c0abd21b17b0b7 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        Either a rml:subject, rml:subjectMap is required, not multiple.\n        " .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLSubjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    Subject Map must generate a resource representing the subject of\n    an RDF triple.\n    " .
_:nb95e36dfe2d14214b2b7a390db06555ab25 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> <http://w3id.org/rml/field> .
