_:nff38e38b9aa34c9393b2c79b84c7ab0cb8 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#alternativePath> _:nff38e38b9aa34c9393b2c79b84c7ab0cb9 .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLRefObjectMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#property> _:nf106a32cee6e4b8091a0d24c209afc75b1 .
_:n1411e73ead8e410390ba935a1aae3885b8 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#first> _:n1411e73ead8e410390ba935a1aae3885b5 .
_:nf8ec2c37b7b74639ad91191739e57ee9b2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        rml:encoding must be provided as an IRI.\n        " .
_:nd391722810e340ac9414f6a00f3f3b0fb2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#node> <http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/FieldShape> .
<http://w3id.org/rml/shapes/RMLChildMapShape> <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n    rml:ChildMap must specify a literal referencing data in the child data\n    source.\n    " .
_:nb95e36dfe2d14214b2b7a390db06555ab2 <http://www.w3.org/ns/shacl#message> "\n        At least one rml:field property must be specified for a rml:LogicalView, with either an rml:ExpressionField or an rml:IterableField its value.\n        " .
_:nff38e38b9aa34c9393b2c79b84c7ab0cb4 <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#rest> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#nil> .
